REMARK 245   NAME OF SAMPLE                 : SPLICEOSOME IMMEDIATELY AFTER     
REMARK 245                                    BRANCHING                         
REMARK 245   SAMPLE CONCENTRATION (MG ML-1) : 0.30                              
REMARK 245   SAMPLE SUPPORT DETAILS         : NULL                              
REMARK 245   SAMPLE VITRIFICATION DETAILS   : 3 MICROLITRES SAMPLE WERE         
REMARK 245                                    APPLIED TO THE GRID, LEFT FOR     
REMARK 245                                    30 SECONDS AND THEN BLOTTED FOR   
REMARK 245                                    2.5-3.0 SECONDS BEFORE PLUNGING.  
REMARK 245   SAMPLE BUFFER                  : NULL                              
REMARK 245   PH                             : 7.80                              
REMARK 245   SAMPLE DETAILS                 : SPLICING EXTRACT WAS PREPARED     
REMARK 245  FROM PRP18-HA OR SLU7-TAPS YEAST STRAINS. AN IN VITRO               
REMARK 245  TRANSCRIBED YEAST UBC4 PRE-MRNA SUBSTRATE (WITH 2 X MS2             
REMARK 245  BACTERIOPHAGE COAT PROTEIN-BINDING STEM LOOPS AT THE 5' END AND     
REMARK 245  WITH THE 3'-SPLICE SITE SEQUENCE UAGAG MUTATED TO UACAC) WAS PRE-   
REMARK 245  BOUND TO AN MS2-MALTOSE BINDING PROTEIN FUSION PROTEIN. THIS        
REMARK 245  SUBSTRATE-PROTEIN COMPLEX WAS ADDED TO THE SPLICING EXTRACT. THE    
REMARK 245  SPLICING REACTION PROCEEDED THROUGH THE FIRST STEP BUT THE          
REMARK 245  SECOND STEP WAS BLOCKED BY THE 3' SPLICE SITE MUTATION.             
REMARK 245  SUBSTRATE-BOUND SPLICEOSOMES FROM THE SPLICING EXTRACT WERE         
REMARK 245  PURIFIED ON AMYLOSE RESIN AND ELUTED WITH MALTOSE. SUBSEQUENTLY     
REMARK 245  THE SPLICEOSOMES WERE CAPTURED ON ANTI-HA-AGAROSE (FOR PRP18-HA-    
REMARK 245  TAGGED) OR STREPTACTIN RESIN (FOR SLU7-TAPS TAGGED) AND ELUTED      
REMARK 245  WITH HA PEPTIDE OR DESTHIOBIOTIN, RESPECTIVELY. PURIFIED            
REMARK 245  SPLICEOSOMES WERE THEN DIALYSED AGAINST 20 MM HEPES KOH PH 7.8,     
REMARK 245  75 MM KCL, 0.25 MM EDTA                                             
REMARK 245                                                                      
